    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wake up, old timer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wet. Warm. Soft. The soil is flowing."
    },
    {
        "text": "Silent. Gentle. Slow. The mind is sinking."
    },
    {
        "text": "Urgh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "It'll get away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.7,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "The scorching moonlight pours down upon his skull. The soil beneath him seems to boil. The heat chases his fading consciousness out of the void. He opens his eyes to the stinging pain."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.7,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_cloakmovement"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. That's it. Stand up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How... how long have I been out?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Five minutes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Five minutes. I've wasted too much time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "One second can be the difference between life and death.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "But this time, you have time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go to the lake. Retrieve your spear.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The hunter's spear\u2014his companion, his lifeline\u2014lies half-submerged in the lake."
    },
    {
        "text": "He does not remember why he laid it down. It was akin to laying down his own life."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_jump_water"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "He pulls it out from the mud. The blood on its tip remains fresh."
    },
    {
        "text": "You should wash your face. You've been chasing it for three days and three nights.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Only three days. I'm not <i>that</i> old.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where did the beast run off to?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's wounded. It can't have gone far. It must be licking its wounds in some corner of the forest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The forest...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
