    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.5,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "He casts his gaze towards the forest.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "The tree trunks reach upwards like spinal columns, with ribs spreading out like branches and countless slabs of meat hanging from them.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 25,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Dark fat piles up in the air, filled with sanguine fluids threatening to pour out at any moment.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 25,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "You're scared.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$leaveshake",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#6$1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Nonsense.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're filled with doubt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doubt as to whether it's you moving forward, or the forest quickly approaching, with fangs bared.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "You want to turn around and run.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Impossible.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't try to hide it. I see it all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I'm not here to dispute your fear.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "The forest <i>is</i> a monster. Everything about it is worth fearing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "A monster...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "A monster straight out of a nightmare, spreading its gaping jaws wide, tearing life to pieces. That's the true face of the forest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, so it is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it is not undefeatable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you remember the last you saw of me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I do. I'll never forget.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you angry?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, so angry that I'm trembling from head to toe, my nails digging deep into my palms.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. Be angry. You need that anger.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "You will feel fear, panic, and pain, but rage will wash it all away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing can stand in the path of your fury. Your wrath will sweep away the forest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. I shall rage, pull the forest's fangs from its jaws, and cut off its claws.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will do to it what it did to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good. There are blood trails over there. Take a look.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_cloakmovement"
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "middle",
        "type": "move",
        "ypos": -50,
        "isblock": true,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Tch...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's still warm. It bleeds. Its wounds have reopened.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "middle",
        "type": "move",
        "ypos": 50,
        "isblock": true,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The trail stops here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "See the scratch marks on the trees? Observe carefully.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't need you to tell me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "The marks are deep. It must have clawed at it many times, ripping away the bark.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "At the edge of the marks are blood-soaked hairs. There are more on the ground.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "These creatures are becoming more and more cunning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It knows the blood will give it away. It rubbed sawdust into its wounds to stop the bleeding, then cut the existing marks deeper to hide its trail.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "But a beast is just a beast. A bar of graphite will leave its trail on paper, no matter how thin it is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The fruits of the cockleweed cling to the fur of passing animals, hitching a ride on them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look at the path they have laid for us. Ha...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It entered that cave.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_angervoice",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's that? I've never heard such a sound...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like we have a new friend.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The sound of its voice excites me. Could it be...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Be patient. A hunter should stay focused on the quarry at hand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
