        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$suspenseful_intro",
        "key": "$suspenseful_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "I know you're in there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_snarl_1",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.8,
        "xstrength": 50,
        "ystrength": 50,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your wounds hurt. You're bleeding. Why won't licking stop it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "How does it feel to be the prey?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you remember the lives you tore apart with your claws and fangs? Did you ever imagine how they felt?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, you're just like me, tired and hungry. This is the end for both of us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "There is nowhere to run. No choice but to fight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, I understand now. Perhaps you need some stimulation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aged Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_knife"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.8,
        "xstrength": 50,
